## Goal
Run a principal component analysis of the gene count matrix and plot the samples with points
coloured by condition, so the overall sample structure can be inspected visually. The analysis
reports the PCA coordinates, the variance each component explains, and the plot; it does not
test for differences between conditions.

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
below are what they resolve to today.

| Artifact type | Resolved from | Path |
