| results/pca_variance_explained.tsv | table | Fraction and cumulative fraction of variance per component; number of genes used |
| results/pca_pc1_pc2.png | figure | PC1 vs PC2 scatter, points coloured by condition and labelled by sample |
| results/pca_pc1_pc2.pdf | figure | The same plot as vector PDF |

## Execution
Runs: batch
One batch job, 1 CPU, 4 GB memory, 15-minute time limit; expected wall time under 2 minutes
for a 200-gene × 6-sample matrix. Expected output size well under 5 MB in total.
